  "referenceNumber": "RUS3185",
  "remarks": "\nThe Secretary of State has reasonable grounds to suspect that ALTRUM GROUP FZCO is an involved person under the Russia (EU Exit) (Sanctions) Regulations 2019 on the basis of the following ground: ALTRUM GROUP FZCO is or has been involved in obtaining a benefit from or supporting the Government of Russia by carrying on business in a sector of strategic significance to the Government of Russia, namely the Russian energy sector, including by dealing with UK-specified ships. \n",
